cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and please also cite Forrester's World Dynamics."
title: "World2 in Python: A Staged, Validated Translation of Jay W. Forrester's World Dynamics Model"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/professorf/world-dynamics"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Python translation of Jay W. Forrester's World2 model from World Dynamics
  (1971; 2nd ed. 1973), in three stages: a card-for-card isomorph of the
  original DYNAMO listing, the same code with readable names, and a modern
  version with policy switches. All three versions reproduce every figure in
  Chapter 4 of the book, including its pollution-crisis, crowding and
  food-shortage experiments. Claudia (Claude Interactive Assistant) is
  Claude, an AI model by Anthropic.
keywords:
  - system dynamics
  - World2
  - World Dynamics
  - Jay W. Forrester
  - DYNAMO
  - simulation
  - Python
authors:
  - family-names: Flor
    given-names: Nick V.
    affiliation: University of New Mexico
    email: nickflor@unm.edu
  - name: "Claudia (Claude Interactive Assistant)"
references:
  - type: book
    title: "World Dynamics"
    authors:
      - family-names: Forrester
        given-names: Jay W.
    edition: "2nd"
    year: 1973
    publisher:
      name: Wright-Allen Press
      city: Cambridge, MA
    notes: "First edition published 1971. The equations are from Appendix B; the validation figures are from Chapter 4."
